CH({slug:'ch18-bad-data',n:'18',part:'Part IV · Running them',sub:'You can’t edit an immutable log, so prevention comes first.',end:'Prevention is cheapest by far.',scenes:[
ST('Bad data meets an immutable log',[['1. Prevention','Schemas, validation and tests. Fail fast. Cheapest by far.','green',.6],['2. Event design','State events let you overwrite mistakes.','amber',.8],['3. Rewind, rebuild, retry','The last resort.','red',1]],['In a database you would just fix the row. A stream is an immutable log.','So you need strategies, <b>in this order</b>.']),
PT('Prevention',[['A real schema format','Avro, Protobuf or JSON Schema, with a registry.','blue'],['Data quality rules','Checked at serialization time. Schemas check types, not meaning.','amber'],['Tests','For serializers, rules and business logic.','green']],['The recurring cause: producers writing without a strict schema, rules or tests.']),
VS('Careful with dead-letter queues','What it does',['Parks the bad event','Lets the rest carry on','Someone still has to repair and resend it'],'What consumers see',['A stream that looks error-free','But is incomplete','Fine only when order doesn’t matter'],['A dead-letter queue just postpones the problem.'],'→','amber','red'),
VS('Event design decides how fixable you are','Deltas: build forward',['They can’t be compacted','Each depends on the one before','Write compensating deltas','One correct state, endless wrong ones'],'State: fix once, at the source',['Publish the corrected record','Every consumer picks it up','Compaction removes the bad one','Consumers still undo decisions already made']),
PL('Rewind, rebuild, retry',[['Stop the damage','Pause producers and consumers.'],['Repair the stream','Produce a corrected one.'],['Rewind offsets','Consumers start again.'],['Rebuild state','And re-emit corrected output.','green']],['Expensive, and it touches every downstream service.'],{tc:'amber'}),
RC('18',[['Immutable log','You can’t edit history.'],['Prevent','Schemas, rules, tests.'],['Dead-letter queues','A last-ditch measure.'],['State events','Fix once, at the source.'],['Rewind','Only when you must.']])
]});
